sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Recruiter
    participant C as Caddy
    participant A as api
    participant G as Google
    participant S as Secrets Manager
    participant P as postgres as app_admin

    Note over S,A: First boot reads the OAuth client into .env. The secret never sits in user data.
    R->>C: GET /admin
    C-->>R: Sign in with Google
    R->>C: GET /api/admin/login/google
    C->>A: GET /admin/login/google
    A-->>R: redirect to Google, hd=janus-soft.com, Drive read-only
    R->>G: Workspace password and consent
    G-->>R: redirect to /api/admin/login/google/callback
    R->>A: code and signed state
    A->>G: exchange the code
    G-->>A: email, hosted domain, refresh token
    A->>A: email must be verified and end with @janus-soft.com
    A->>P: store an admin session row
    A-->>R: HttpOnly cookie, then /admin/dashboard
    Note over R,G: A @gmail.com address is refused. The password login has no Drive token.
